 can choose between Horizontal and Vertical.\n\nFollowing that ideal world scenario, I'd also change the name of the integer property that determines the maximum amount of column or rows to `Limit` taking backward compatibility into account of course. ","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98681#pullrequestreview-3903380554","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98681","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98681#pullrequestreview-3903380554"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98681"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-06T12:13:01Z","commit_id":"1ae4f1a3dff4083c8f7a45219a8035f101050e60"}]